{"unit_id":"Void-LifeStream__dsh-phone-butler#feature-1","repo":"Void-LifeStream/dsh-phone-butler","commit":"3b8d15c7a6f8d3d599df1ee5e04a4e62d05e87ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-phone-butler 的功能「手机存储盘点」：读取缓存、目录占用、大文件位置和空目录数量，汇总手机共享存储的使用情况。调用 phone_scan，可按应用、缓存、目录或大文件类型查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/entry.js:367-420","lib/adb.js:235-259"]}
